AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms ExtendedLoss rule was triggered, indicating sustained packet
loss above the configured threshold over an extended period on the monitored path.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

Congestion, a degraded network link, or an intermittently failing device along the
monitored path, as determined by AppNeta's own monitoring criteria for this rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
